{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender RNA Runtime and Generator Phases.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender RNA Runtime and Generator Phases.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender rna runtime and generator phases blender rna runtime and generator phases","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender RNA Runtime and Generator Phases.md","fileName":"Blender RNA Runtime and Generator Phases.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender RNA Runtime and Generator Phases","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender RNA Data Architecture]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender RNA Data Architecture","Blender RNA Definition API","Blender RNA Generated Source","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender RNA Runtime and Generator Phases.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender RNA Runtime and Generator Phases.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender rna runtime and generator phases blender rna runtime and generator phases","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender RNA Runtime and Generator Phases.md","fileName":"Blender RNA Runtime and Generator Phases.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender RNA Runtime and Generator Phases","heading":"Blender RNA Runtime and Generator Phases","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Blender's RNA build separates non-runtime code that describes and generates an interface from runtime code that executes inside the application. Some repository files contain both portions and use preprocessing to select which part is compiled.\n\nThe build first compiles the `makesrna` generator, then emitted files define the runtime macro and include the appropriate source again. This two-phase design lets [[Blender RNA Definition API]] calls produce efficient [[Blender